00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.868
Well, guys, it's a busy time in New York City because leaders

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:13.834
from all around the world are in town

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:16.534
for the U.N. General Assembly. Yeah.

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:19.200
And I just want to say on behalf of all New Yorkers,

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.501
this could have been a Zoom.

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:22.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.200
