00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.000
Two and a half hours to go three blocks?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.367
What are we doing, people?

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:32.734
Yeah, this is the first in-person General Assembly

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:34.901
since the pandemic. That's right.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.868
For the last three years, the U.N. has been home

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.133
