00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.901
Fun fact. Fun fact. Fun fact.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:44.834
[ Applause ]

00:00:44.834 --> 00:00:47.467
That's right. Today leaders from 193 nations

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:49.734
flew into New York on private jets

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:52.000
and drove into the U.N. in huge motorcades

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.801
all with one shared goal -- to fight climate change.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.901
Honestly, I love when the U.N. General Assembly is in session.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:05.300
